+# Fetching — rate limits and mirrors
+
+Source: Muninn episode record for this project (session 14a6ab47, 2026-09-13, trust 1 — observed in this project's own session transcript, not re-verified here).
+
+## Rate limit
+
+- 12 visits per 60 s, per domain.
+- Cooldown after a breach: 900 s.
+
+## Mirror / CDN hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>`
+- `cdn.statically.io` — noted as slow / prone to timeouts.
+
+Fetched files were written flat into `~/.svipall/out/`.
